			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Modularize NodeResolver into PascalCase submodules\n\nDecompose the monolithic `NodeResolver.rs` into a dedicated submodule tree to align with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention. Extract logical units into separate files: `ResolveNodeBinary` for the main caching entry point, `ResolveUncached` for the resolution ladder, `TryShipped` through `TryVolta` for each manager-specific lookup, and `CheckMinMajor`, `QueryNodeVersion`, `ExpandHome`, and `NodeExecutableName` for utility logic. Rename `ResolvedNode` and `NodeSource` to `Struct` and `Enum` variants respectively.\n\nSimultaneously, modularize `Source/Error/mod.rs` to document the local error taxonomy as dead code since all consumers now utilize `CommonLibrary::Error::CommonError`. Update `Source/ProcessManagement/CocoonManagement.rs` and `Source/ProcessManagement/ExtractDevTag.rs` to reflect the new `Fn` function naming and `Struct` type usage.\n\nThis structural refactor preserves all Node binary resolution logic (override → shipped → managers → PATH) and version checking behavior while establishing a consistent namespace hierarchy for future extension host lifecycle management.",
			"SHA": "def6b305df7afe651bdfaf946ea4554b3b4193f3"
		},
