				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				896,
				7
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Modularize UpdateService into PascalCase submodules\n\nDecompose the monolithic `UpdateService.rs` file into a dedicated submodule tree (`UpdateService/`) to align with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention. Extract logical units into separate files: `CheckForUpdates` for Tauri-based updates, `CheckForUpdatesViaAir` for Air gRPC delegation, `CheckForUpdatesWithAir` for mode-aware routing, `UpdateMode` for configuration enums, and `IsAirAvailable` for health checks. Rename all public functions and types to strict PascalCase (e.g., `Fn`, `Enum`, `Struct`) and consolidate the logic into an atomic `Update` module declaration.\n\nThis structural refactor preserves all existing update checking logic (Tauri and Air integration) while establishing a consistent namespace hierarchy for future feature expansion, such as wire-up from the Help menu or Air-centric update downloads.",
			"SHA": "fe5ab2a8f343676f12ce93e8cab2dbda687f8d72"
		}
